he drone's physics. You can also save your profiles and use them later. The profile format is open so you can share it with your friends.\n\nGamepads are supported and enabled by default. Radio transmitters are currently partially supported.\n\nThis trial includes one level, one drone and two game modes.", "short_description": "DVR Simulator is a Drone Racing FPV Simulator. It features two flight modes, Freestyle and Racing. Simulates FPV Goggles using your VR headset. Many modes are available."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.demonixis.net/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Demonixis Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.demonixis.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "SIMULATION", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "182408151163887"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982685_405123950944556_2189061053881666015_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2OT8wo8xfOoQ7kNvwGf0I79&_nc_oc=Adl6-55Me827qI8szQSbagWsvXMqAltaHCLBza-2eornzBMucw7pZa70r9uKr8fVdB4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs5fFN-RBBj1mdnRJFiHd-KZNzxSfM1u1--PHav7iVtvA&oe=6998484E"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false